{
    "title": "Sonic The Hedgehog 2 Classic",
    "description": "One of the best-selling SEGA games of all time - Sonic The Hedgehog 2 is now available on mobile! Rediscover SEGA\u2019s classic Super Sonic masterpiece! The second game in the Sonic the Hedgehog franchise brings more running, more jumping and more awesome classic arcade action!\r\n\r\nDr. Eggman is back to his old tricks, trying to find the seven Chaos Emeralds that will enable him to complete his ultimate weapon, the Death Egg. Only Sonic the Hedgehog, Tails, and Knuckles can defeat him in this remaster from the SEGA team behind Sonic Mania!\r\n\r\nSonic The Hedgehog 2 joins the ever-increasing line-up of \u2018SEGA Forever\u2019, a treasure trove of SEGA console classic games brought to life on mobile for the first time!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n- Twelve Badnik-infested zones to master, from underwater caverns to neon-lit casinos!\r\n- Run, jump and spin through epic courses with Sonic, Tails, Knuckles and more!\r\n- Choose from three exciting play modes: Online, Time Attack and Boss Attack mode!\r\n- Fight Dr. Eggman\u2019s creations, including the terrifying Mecha Sonic\r\n- Obtain all the Chaos Emeralds to transform into Super Sonic and Super Knuckles!\r\n\r\nMOBILE GAME FEATURES\r\n- <b>Classic Sonic Arcade Games Action</b> with ad-support or ad-free via In-App Purchase.\r\n- <b>Save Your Game Progress</b> at any point in your adventure.\r\n- <b>Compete Globally</b> on leaderboards for high scores.\r\n- <b>Video Game Controller Support</b> with all HID compatible controllers. Play the classic arcade game with modern video game controllers!\r\n\r\nCLASSIC ARCADE GAMES\r\nIf you\u2019re a fan of classic arcade games, you\u2019ll love Sonic the Hedgehog 2! SEGA has remastered some of the top classics from the 90\u2019s with modern controls and emulators. Play original arcade games right on your modern mobile devices! Start playing now!\r\n\r\n- - - - -\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://privacy.sega.com/en/soa-pp\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.sega.com/EULA\r\n\r\nSonic The Hedgehog 2 is ad-supported and no in-app purchases are required to progress; ad-free play is available with an in-app purchase.\r\n\r\nOther than for users known to be under 13, this game may include \"Interest Based Ads\" and may collect \"Precise Location Data\". Please see our privacy policy for more information.\r\n\r\n\u00a9SEGA. All rights reserved. SEGA, the SEGA logo, Sonic The Hedgehog 2, SEGA Forever, and the SEGA Forever logo are registered trademarks or trademarks of SEGA CORPORATION or its affiliates.",
    "descriptionHTML": "One of the best-selling SEGA games of all time - Sonic The Hedgehog 2 is now available on mobile! Rediscover SEGA\u2019s classic Super Sonic masterpiece! The second game in the Sonic the Hedgehog franchise brings more running, more jumping and more awesome classic arcade action!<br><br>Dr. Eggman is back to his old tricks, trying to find the seven Chaos Emeralds that will enable him to complete his ultimate weapon, the Death Egg. Only Sonic the Hedgehog, Tails, and Knuckles can defeat him in this remaster from the SEGA team behind Sonic Mania!<br><br>Sonic The Hedgehog 2 joins the ever-increasing line-up of \u2018SEGA Forever\u2019, a treasure trove of SEGA console classic games brought to life on mobile for the first time!<br><br>FEATURES<br>- Twelve Badnik-infested zones to master, from underwater caverns to neon-lit casinos!<br>- Run, jump and spin through epic courses with Sonic, Tails, Knuckles and more!<br>- Choose from three exciting play modes: Online, Time Attack and Boss Attack mode!<br>- Fight Dr. Eggman\u2019s creations, including the terrifying Mecha Sonic<br>- Obtain all the Chaos Emeralds to transform into Super Sonic and Super Knuckles!<br><br>MOBILE GAME FEATURES<br>- <b>Classic Sonic Arcade Games Action</b> with ad-support or ad-free via In-App Purchase.<br>- <b>Save Your Game Progress</b> at any point in your adventure.<br>- <b>Compete Globally</b> on leaderboards for high scores.<br>- <b>Video Game Controller Support</b> with all HID compatible controllers. Play the classic arcade game with modern video game controllers!<br><br>CLASSIC ARCADE GAMES<br>If you\u2019re a fan of classic arcade games, you\u2019ll love Sonic the Hedgehog 2! SEGA has remastered some of the top classics from the 90\u2019s with modern controls and emulators. Play original arcade games right on your modern mobile devices! Start playing now!<br><br>- - - - -<br>Privacy Policy: https://privacy.sega.com/en/soa-pp<br>Terms of Use: https://www.sega.com/EULA<br><br>Sonic The Hedgehog 2 is ad-supported and no in-app purchases are required to progress; ad-free play is available with an in-app purchase.<br><br>Other than for users known to be under 13, this game may include &quot;Interest Based Ads&quot; and may collect &quot;Precise Location Data&quot;. Please see our privacy policy for more information.<br><br>\u00a9SEGA. All rights reserved. SEGA, the SEGA logo, Sonic The Hedgehog 2, SEGA Forever, and the SEGA Forever logo are registered trademarks or trademarks of SEGA CORPORATION or its affiliates.",
